      "description": "How to read and operate the Path Forecast Ribbon dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 79 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
  "content": "## What this shows\n\n- Ribbon: q10/q50/q90 forecast for ${index} at ${horizon}m.\n- TP: Live target price (straddle) overlay.\n- Coverage: Realized share inside [q10,q90] over Diagnostics window.\n- Advisor: Summarizes health, samples, and gap to target.\n\n## Key toggles\n\n- Index: Market to visualize.\n- Expiry tag: Select live_csv source (auto/this_week/next_week/this_month/next_month).\n- Horizon (min): 30/60/390; affects ribbon and stats.\n- Profile: Optimized/Base/Since_open/Wide_bands/Retrieval_only/Conservative/High_variance.\n- Forecaster mode: auto | hybrid | retrieval.\n- Window (min): Lookback window for retrieval/features.\n- Neighbors (k): Retrieval blend size (higher = smoother).\n- Bucket (ms): Time bucket (1m=60000, 5m=300000).\n- Time align: trailing (history) | future (project ahead) | auto.\n- Calibrate: Apply band_scale so coverage ≈ target.\n- Date / now_override_ms: Replay specific day/time (ISO date, epoch ms).\n- Diagnostics window: Coverage/stat window length.\n- History (min): Visual history for snapshot series.\n- Calibrate target: Desired coverage (default 0.8).\n- Gap warn/crit: |actual-target| thresholds (0.05/0.10).\n- Min samples warn/crit: Data sufficiency thresholds (30/10).\n\n## Tips\n\n- For future view, set Time align=future and use \"Zoom next ${horizon}m\".\n- Compare Calibrated vs Raw panels to assess calibration impact.\n- Larger Window and k stabilize bands but can reduce reactivity.\n- Date + now_override_ms keep Ribbon/Meta/Stats aligned for replay.\n\n## Useful endpoints\n\n- Health: ${base_url}/health\n- Routes: ${base_url}/api/routes\n- OpenAPI: ${base_url}/openapi.json\n- Docs UI: ${base_url}/docs\n"
      }
    }
